            "\\subsection{Performance on General Visual-Language Tasks}\n",
            "\\vspace{-1mm}\n",
            "Although it is not the focus of our work, we report in Tab.~\\ref{table:general-visual-language} results on general vision-language tasks, including OK-VQA \\cite{okvqa}, VQA v2 \\cite{balanced_vqa_v2} and COCO captioning \\cite{coco}.\n",
            "A single, generalist PaLM-E-562B model achieves the highest reported number on OK-VQA, including outperforming models finetuned specifically on OK-VQA.\n",
            "Compared to \\cite{tsimpoukelli2021multimodal}, PaLM-E achieves the highest performance on VQA v2 with a frozen LLM to the best of our knowledge.\n",
            "This establishes that PaLM-E is a competitive visual-language generalist, in addition to being an embodied reasoner on robotic tasks.\n",
